WEBVTT

00:00:03.080 --> 00:00:04.730
What should I do?

00:00:08.150 --> 00:00:09.510
Excuse me!

00:00:11.470 --> 00:00:14.530
Could you save this kitty?

00:00:15.140 --> 00:00:16.490
Give me the cat.

00:00:16.490 --> 00:00:17.290
Okay.

00:00:19.610 --> 00:00:20.580
Thank y—

00:00:21.180 --> 00:00:23.210
Thank you!

00:00:27.820 --> 00:00:31.090
The average water temperature 
in July is 26 degrees.

00:00:31.090 --> 00:00:32.760
You won't catch a cold.

00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:34.890
Try not to be late.

00:00:36.260 --> 00:00:37.780
Okay!

00:02:08.980 --> 00:02:11.440
First Period

00:02:08.980 --> 00:02:11.440
Cooking Class

00:02:08.980 --> 00:02:11.440
July 12

00:02:11.760 --> 00:02:12.680
Are you okay?

00:02:12.680 --> 00:02:16.400
Yeah! A cool lady saved me.

00:02:16.400 --> 00:02:21.870
Summer Plans

00:02:16.950 --> 00:02:21.870
Amusement parks, the beach, botanical 
gardens, festivals, the aquarium...

00:02:22.400 --> 00:02:26.080
Any other requests for summer break activities?

00:02:26.350 --> 00:02:28.520
Let's do all of it!

00:02:28.520 --> 00:02:30.540
Have you forgotten about final exams already?

00:02:31.060 --> 00:02:33.530
A student's primary responsibility is studying.

00:02:33.530 --> 00:02:35.210
We can't just play the whole time.

00:02:35.960 --> 00:02:37.470
You're right.

00:02:37.470 --> 00:02:40.010
Then let's do our homework at someone's house!

00:02:40.980 --> 00:02:42.970
A sleepover sounds wonderful, too.

00:02:43.520 --> 00:02:45.970
Our next class is in the cooking classroom, right?

00:02:45.970 --> 00:02:49.730
<b>Episode 9</b>

00:02:45.970 --> 00:02:49.730
<b>July 13</b>

00:02:45.970 --> 00:02:49.730
<b>A Stormy Group Lesson</b>

00:02:51.910 --> 00:02:55.190
This is our first joint lesson with another class.

00:02:55.700 --> 00:02:59.660
Our class is pretty much 
entirely taught by Ms. Kodaira.

00:02:59.660 --> 00:03:01.740
I'm having palpitations...

00:03:01.740 --> 00:03:03.410
Do you want to go to the nurse's office?

00:03:03.780 --> 00:03:07.120
Oh, it's not one of my usual health problems.

00:03:07.120 --> 00:03:12.200
I have absolutely no experience 
cooking, so I'm just nervous.

00:03:12.200 --> 00:03:14.240
You'll be fine, Botan-chan.

00:03:14.240 --> 00:03:14.630
Huh?

00:03:14.630 --> 00:03:16.440
I don't, either.

00:03:16.900 --> 00:03:17.920
Oh, my...

00:03:20.280 --> 00:03:25.490
Cooking Class
Recipes using summer vegetables
One dessert

00:03:21.360 --> 00:03:25.490
Hello, everyone. Today's lesson 
will be taught by me, Ms. Kodaira...

00:03:27.810 --> 00:03:29.140
And me, Ms. Saginomiya.

00:03:29.420 --> 00:03:31.660
She's the lady who helped me this morning.

00:03:31.660 --> 00:03:32.650
Her?

00:03:32.650 --> 00:03:37.610
I imagine you all spend most of your days 
devoting yourselves to academics and sports.

00:03:38.160 --> 00:03:41.860
However, any student of the 
distinguished Tennomifune Academy

00:03:42.220 --> 00:03:46.280
must aim to be perfect,
even with your cooking skills!

00:03:48.510 --> 00:03:50.140
She's really intense.

00:03:50.140 --> 00:03:53.460
Apparently she normally 
teaches academic courses.

00:03:54.430 --> 00:03:56.220
You three! No talking!

00:03:56.790 --> 00:03:58.250
Sorry!

00:03:59.350 --> 00:04:01.220
The vegetables are running away!

00:04:06.220 --> 00:04:07.400
Okay...

00:04:07.400 --> 00:04:09.100
You can do it, Hanako-san!

00:04:09.590 --> 00:04:11.130
Don't run...

00:04:13.450 --> 00:04:17.180
I did it! I did it, Botan-chan and Hibari-chan!

00:04:17.180 --> 00:04:19.500
Congratulations, Hanako-san.

00:04:20.110 --> 00:04:21.740
On to the next cut!

00:04:24.250 --> 00:04:25.370
Wait... Huh?

00:04:26.040 --> 00:04:27.990
Huh? It won't cut.

00:04:28.580 --> 00:04:30.370
The blade is dull.

00:04:30.690 --> 00:04:34.190
Um... You two can help me.

00:04:34.190 --> 00:04:35.330
Okay!

00:04:37.540 --> 00:04:40.120
"A secret recipe to win his heart..."

00:04:40.860 --> 00:04:42.640
Hanako, turn on the stove.

00:04:42.640 --> 00:04:43.510
Okay.

00:04:46.060 --> 00:04:46.640
Huh?

00:04:50.050 --> 00:04:52.100
Is it in a bad mood?

00:04:55.370 --> 00:04:56.780
Are you okay, Hanako?!

00:04:56.780 --> 00:04:58.310
We need to put out the flames!

00:04:58.850 --> 00:05:00.070
Botan!

00:05:01.550 --> 00:05:04.550
<b>First-years</b>

00:05:02.200 --> 00:05:03.720
First-years!

00:05:11.220 --> 00:05:12.950
The damage isn't serious,

00:05:13.290 --> 00:05:15.760
but we can't use this stove anymore.

00:05:15.760 --> 00:05:18.420
To be safe, I'll examine the 
cause of the fire later.

00:05:18.680 --> 00:05:20.130
S-Sorry.

00:05:20.770 --> 00:05:22.480
Accidents like this happen

00:05:22.480 --> 00:05:25.340
every year during joint lessons
with the happiness class.

00:05:25.630 --> 00:05:26.460
Huh?

00:05:26.460 --> 00:05:29.430
Be careful not to cause any more trouble.

00:05:31.880 --> 00:05:33.680
We can't mess up like that again.

00:05:33.680 --> 00:05:35.720
Sorry, it was my fault.

00:05:35.720 --> 00:05:38.360
I'm sorry I'm so useless.

00:05:39.160 --> 00:05:40.970
I was careless, too.

00:05:40.970 --> 00:05:42.980
We can't make curry without a stove.

00:05:43.460 --> 00:05:45.280
What should we cook?

00:05:50.690 --> 00:05:52.990
Hey, how does baked curry sound?

00:05:53.290 --> 00:05:56.370
Huh? Can we bake it without a stove?

00:05:56.640 --> 00:05:59.040
You can make it in a microwave or toaster oven.

00:05:59.040 --> 00:06:01.630
My mom's made it for me before.

00:06:01.920 --> 00:06:04.880
I see. Okay, we'll go with Hanako's idea.

00:06:04.880 --> 00:06:06.700
Let's pull ourselves together and start over.

00:06:06.700 --> 00:06:08.090
Yeah!

00:06:09.140 --> 00:06:10.760
Excalibur!

00:06:11.600 --> 00:06:13.560
Class 1-7

00:06:11.600 --> 00:06:13.560
Kumegawa Botan: Passed out 
when flames erupted from stove
Sakuradai Kiku: Detail-oriented
Shiina Fumi: Cooks dexterously
Shimoigusa Ume:
Hanakoizumi Anne:
Hibarigaoka Ruri:

00:06:14.240 --> 00:06:17.880
<i>Compared to the students in 
the academic and sports classes,</i>

00:06:18.270 --> 00:06:23.790
<i>the students in the happiness class... 
show a clear lack of awareness.</i>

00:06:25.090 --> 00:06:27.030
Hey. Are you finished cooking?

00:06:27.290 --> 00:06:29.110
Ren, wake up.

00:06:30.950 --> 00:06:32.530
Our food's right there.

00:06:32.940 --> 00:06:34.380
Watermelon is a vegetable.

00:06:34.380 --> 00:06:36.790
It can also be dessert, which saves time.

00:06:37.360 --> 00:06:38.250
Three points.

00:06:38.500 --> 00:06:42.250
Wait. Don't grade us until you've tried these.

00:06:43.350 --> 00:06:48.030
Hagyu Hibiki's Fersen of summer 
brilliance, sadness, and love!

00:06:48.030 --> 00:06:50.720
Is that what they call rice balls now?

00:06:50.720 --> 00:06:52.810
Please try one.

00:06:58.210 --> 00:07:00.600
There's watermelon and sugar in this.

00:07:00.950 --> 00:07:03.320
Ren and I are of one heart and mind,

00:07:03.320 --> 00:07:06.990
so we both thought to create 
a vegetable dessert.

00:07:06.990 --> 00:07:08.960
P-Please leave me out of this.

00:07:08.960 --> 00:07:10.280
Negative 300 points.

00:07:16.610 --> 00:07:17.710
Next is...

00:07:18.440 --> 00:07:20.240
Baked dry curry, huh?

00:07:20.240 --> 00:07:20.910
Yes.

00:07:21.430 --> 00:07:23.130
It doesn't look too bad.

00:07:23.470 --> 00:07:25.290
We somehow finished in time.

00:07:25.290 --> 00:07:26.110
Yeah.

00:07:27.780 --> 00:07:30.540
<i>Cooking with others might actually be fun.</i>

00:07:31.370 --> 00:07:32.510
The vegetable juice!

00:07:32.830 --> 00:07:33.910
I forgot!

00:07:41.460 --> 00:07:42.490
No way...

00:07:43.550 --> 00:07:45.140
I'm not surprised.

00:07:46.310 --> 00:07:48.860
Ma'am, what's our score?

00:07:49.920 --> 00:07:51.070
It's not worth scoring.

00:07:52.290 --> 00:07:56.280
Your cooking is one reason, but you lack 
even the bare minimum of attentiveness.

00:07:57.000 --> 00:08:00.500
"Unfortunate" doesn't even begin to describe it.

00:08:01.030 --> 00:08:07.960
I really don't understand why Tennomifune 
Academy even has a "happiness class."

00:08:12.100 --> 00:08:14.060
Don't worry about it.

00:08:14.520 --> 00:08:17.430
Ms. Saginomiya is always like that.

00:08:20.640 --> 00:08:21.810
It's delicious.

00:08:22.170 --> 00:08:23.560
Thank goodness!

00:08:31.860 --> 00:08:33.240
<i>I really messed up.</i>

00:08:33.840 --> 00:08:34.700
Hibari-san.

00:08:35.600 --> 00:08:36.820
Want to go home together?

00:08:37.880 --> 00:08:38.710
Sure.

00:08:43.290 --> 00:08:45.150
And then the kitty...

00:08:45.150 --> 00:08:45.600
Yes?

00:08:45.600 --> 00:08:48.710
Its neck was hurt, so I...

00:08:51.460 --> 00:08:52.840
Hibari-chan!

00:08:54.240 --> 00:08:55.510
Wh-What?

00:08:55.790 --> 00:08:59.640
I want to stay over at your house tonight.

00:08:59.640 --> 00:09:01.970
Huh? Where did this come from?

00:09:02.310 --> 00:09:04.730
We were talking about it this morning.

00:09:04.730 --> 00:09:06.540
Wasn't that for summer break?

00:09:06.540 --> 00:09:07.690
Can't I?

00:09:08.030 --> 00:09:09.900
Can't we?

00:09:11.270 --> 00:09:14.360
I-I'm not saying you can't, but...

00:09:14.360 --> 00:09:16.730
Really? All right!

00:09:17.250 --> 00:09:18.360
Lucky us!

00:09:18.360 --> 00:09:19.400
Yay!

00:09:21.730 --> 00:09:23.100
Now everything's ready.

00:09:25.280 --> 00:09:26.710
W-Welcome.

00:09:27.000 --> 00:09:28.210
Good evening!

00:09:28.620 --> 00:09:30.790
You got permission from your parents?

00:09:30.790 --> 00:09:33.790
Yeah. By the way, I know I just got here,

00:09:33.790 --> 00:09:36.000
but Botan-chan collapsed on the way.

00:09:36.000 --> 00:09:38.140
Could you help me carry her?

00:09:38.140 --> 00:09:39.550
You should've said so sooner!

00:09:39.550 --> 00:09:42.560
My things...

00:09:43.680 --> 00:09:46.520
I'm sorry. I suddenly felt dizzy.

00:09:46.860 --> 00:09:49.470
You need to take medicine, 
right? Here's some water.

00:09:49.470 --> 00:09:51.230
Thank you.

00:09:52.680 --> 00:09:55.740
Oh, in place of a gift, Hibari-san,

00:09:56.550 --> 00:09:59.000
perhaps you'd like a drug that allows you to

00:09:59.000 --> 00:10:00.910
move three times faster than normal?

00:10:01.350 --> 00:10:03.120
I appreciate the thought...

00:10:03.120 --> 00:10:05.630
I brought gifts, too.

00:10:05.630 --> 00:10:07.370
You didn't need to do that.

00:10:07.370 --> 00:10:09.820
It's vegetable oil and olive oil.

00:10:09.820 --> 00:10:10.920
Midsummer gifts?

00:10:11.560 --> 00:10:17.670
Anyway... Hibari-chan, your house is super cute!

00:10:18.760 --> 00:10:21.480
My parents don't care much for interior design,

00:10:21.480 --> 00:10:24.160
so I've chosen all the decor since I was a child.

00:10:24.160 --> 00:10:25.930
It's not that we're into girly stuff.

00:10:26.270 --> 00:10:30.650
Really? So this house is full of your memories.

00:10:30.650 --> 00:10:32.810
You really liked the color pink, huh?

00:10:32.810 --> 00:10:37.420
Y-Yeah, in grade school. Not so much now.

00:10:37.420 --> 00:10:41.440
Huh? But Hibari-chan, you wear 
pink underwear all the time.

00:10:41.870 --> 00:10:42.970
When did you see that?!

00:10:42.970 --> 00:10:45.040
When we change for PE.

00:10:49.360 --> 00:10:50.350
You imagined it.

00:10:50.350 --> 00:10:52.000
Oh? Are you sure?

00:10:52.440 --> 00:10:53.980
Oh? But...

00:10:52.440 --> 00:10:54.540
Hibari-chan, you're so cute.

00:10:56.040 --> 00:10:57.960
This is different!

00:11:02.200 --> 00:11:03.470
Hanako, want something to drink?

00:11:03.790 --> 00:11:06.280
Café au lait with lots of milk!

00:11:06.280 --> 00:11:09.100
Hanako-san, you must like milk a lot.

00:11:09.100 --> 00:11:09.980
Yeah.

00:11:09.980 --> 00:11:10.750
Hey, hey...

00:11:10.730 --> 00:11:21.990
<b>Gulp</b>

00:11:11.060 --> 00:11:12.780
If I drink lots of milk,

00:11:12.780 --> 00:11:16.640
do you think it'll make me grow taller 
or make my breasts bigger?

00:11:16.640 --> 00:11:18.350
I'm not sure.

00:11:18.350 --> 00:11:21.990
It upsets my stomach, so I don't drink it much.

00:11:21.990 --> 00:11:23.450
What? Really?

00:11:23.760 --> 00:11:27.370
Come to think of it, I heard that 
a study by a foreign university

00:11:27.370 --> 00:11:30.990
concluded that women who drink lots of coffee

00:11:30.990 --> 00:11:36.840
have 17% smaller breasts than women 
who don't, or something like that.

00:11:39.860 --> 00:11:41.010
Do you want something else?

00:11:41.760 --> 00:11:43.850
I'll drink it. I like it.

00:11:45.010 --> 00:11:46.720
The futons are ready.

00:11:46.720 --> 00:11:48.760
Thanks, Hibari-chan.

00:11:48.760 --> 00:11:50.680
Sorry for all the trouble.

00:11:51.030 --> 00:11:54.650
I put out a fan, but if you get 
too hot, you can turn on the AC.

00:11:55.040 --> 00:11:58.030
Make sure you set the timer 
for it so you don't catch a cold.

00:11:58.030 --> 00:12:00.080
I've already dehumidified the room.

00:12:00.080 --> 00:12:01.860
Hibari-chan, you're like a mom.

00:12:02.880 --> 00:12:04.570
Jeez, sorry...

00:12:04.880 --> 00:12:07.280
Oh, good. You're back to your usual self.

00:12:07.600 --> 00:12:08.250
Huh?

00:12:11.220 --> 00:12:15.960
You seemed a bit down
after today's cooking lesson.

00:12:16.250 --> 00:12:17.710
Th-That was...

00:12:19.700 --> 00:12:20.630
You're right.

00:12:21.010 --> 00:12:24.590
I was just more disgusted with myself 
than I've been in a long time.

00:12:26.040 --> 00:12:29.660
I always pretend to be so 
serious and responsible...

00:12:33.200 --> 00:12:36.610
But I always cause trouble for 
others at critical moments,

00:12:36.610 --> 00:12:38.020
or my actions backfire.

00:12:40.320 --> 00:12:41.980
I really hate myse—

00:12:41.980 --> 00:12:44.450
Hibari-chan, I don't mind 
if you cause me trouble.

00:12:46.630 --> 00:12:47.960
We're friends.

00:12:48.530 --> 00:12:53.830
She's right. We're usually the 
ones causing you trouble.

00:12:54.340 --> 00:12:58.940
It's okay to rely on us or complain 
to us every now and then,

00:12:58.940 --> 00:13:01.550
even though we may not be 
very dependable friends.

00:13:03.240 --> 00:13:05.220
You might be right about that part.

00:13:08.310 --> 00:13:09.530
I'm joking.

00:13:12.930 --> 00:13:14.110
Let's go to bed.

00:13:14.110 --> 00:13:16.390
We have school in the morning.

00:13:16.390 --> 00:13:18.360
Tomorrow's our swimming lesson, right?

00:13:18.360 --> 00:13:22.510
Oh, that's right. I wonder 
if I'll be able to survive...

00:13:22.510 --> 00:13:24.540
Don't worry, Botan-chan. You're buoyant.

00:13:24.540 --> 00:13:25.870
I'm turning out the lights.

00:13:25.870 --> 00:13:27.040
Okay!

00:13:28.870 --> 00:13:30.990
I can't move...

00:13:37.280 --> 00:13:39.560
I'm sorry for the trouble we caused today.

00:13:40.180 --> 00:13:43.710
There was nothing wrong with the 
stove Hanakoizumi Anne used.

00:13:44.000 --> 00:13:45.220
I'm sure there wasn't.

00:13:45.780 --> 00:13:47.800
Why does Tennomifune Academy,

00:13:47.800 --> 00:13:52.600
a prestigious school with applicants 
from all over the country,

00:13:53.030 --> 00:13:58.230
bother with students who don't have
a single redeeming quality?

00:14:00.570 --> 00:14:04.230
I can't give your class special treatment.

00:14:04.690 --> 00:14:07.360
There's no need to.

00:14:07.360 --> 00:14:11.490
If they don't perform well, 
you can give them a lower grade.

00:14:11.800 --> 00:14:16.000
Even if it ends up getting the 
happiness class cancelled?

00:14:25.670 --> 00:14:27.970
So our pool session is a joint class, too?

00:14:28.270 --> 00:14:31.220
There! I'm done changing!

00:14:37.830 --> 00:14:39.960
You really don't drink milk?

00:14:39.960 --> 00:14:40.880
That's right.

00:14:40.880 --> 00:14:43.480
Stop messing around. Let's go.

00:14:43.480 --> 00:14:44.880
Wait for me.

00:14:44.880 --> 00:14:46.360
W-Wait up!

00:14:46.360 --> 00:14:47.960
Hibari-chan!

00:14:49.830 --> 00:14:51.930
Get in up to your shoulders.

00:14:52.760 --> 00:14:54.400
The weather's nice today.

00:14:54.400 --> 00:14:56.370
It's a perfect day for the pool.

00:14:56.790 --> 00:14:59.240
Because the PE teacher is absent,

00:14:59.240 --> 00:15:02.750
the two of us will be conducting 
a joint lesson again today.

00:15:03.000 --> 00:15:05.920
The first hour will be free time.

00:15:06.420 --> 00:15:09.000
Make sure you catch me!

00:15:15.690 --> 00:15:16.620
Ren!

00:15:17.720 --> 00:15:20.310
At least stay awake while 
you're in the water!

00:15:22.060 --> 00:15:23.730
Botan-chan, are those...

00:15:24.340 --> 00:15:26.650
They're prescription goggles.

00:15:26.650 --> 00:15:27.980
Without them,

00:15:27.980 --> 00:15:31.860
my eyes would get so bloodshot
that I couldn't see anything.

00:15:32.400 --> 00:15:34.890
Are you sure it's okay for 
you to get in the water?

00:15:34.890 --> 00:15:37.130
As long as I'm just wading, I think...

00:15:37.130 --> 00:15:40.080
Okay, Botan-chan, let's have an easy contest!

00:15:40.080 --> 00:15:43.180
We'll see who can hold their 
breath longer under the—

00:15:43.180 --> 00:15:43.730
No!

00:15:43.730 --> 00:15:49.150
<b>No!</b>

00:15:43.730 --> 00:15:49.150
<b>No!</b>

00:15:43.730 --> 00:15:49.150
<b>No!</b>

00:15:43.730 --> 00:15:49.150
<b>No!</b>

00:15:46.290 --> 00:15:47.210
No?

00:15:47.210 --> 00:15:48.650
Absolutely not!

00:15:49.450 --> 00:15:53.640
Always avoiding danger may 
not be the path to happiness.

00:15:54.070 --> 00:15:56.140
I'll be watching over you.

00:15:57.250 --> 00:15:58.710
In that case...

00:15:58.930 --> 00:16:01.350
<b>Excited</b>

00:15:58.930 --> 00:16:01.350
<b>Excited</b>

00:15:59.570 --> 00:16:01.350
Okay, I'll time you.

00:16:01.640 --> 00:16:02.560
Ready...

00:16:03.000 --> 00:16:04.520
<i>Float...</i>

00:16:04.520 --> 00:16:05.620
Botan!

00:16:08.260 --> 00:16:11.340
Holding your breath is hard.

00:16:11.340 --> 00:16:14.320
I could probably hold it 
permanently if I tried, but...

00:16:14.320 --> 00:16:15.820
You don't need to do that.

00:16:16.770 --> 00:16:18.200
By the way, where's Hanako?

00:16:18.200 --> 00:16:20.750
<b>Whirrrrr</b>

00:16:20.160 --> 00:16:21.450
<b>Splash</b>

00:16:20.950 --> 00:16:22.160
Hanako?!

00:16:22.160 --> 00:16:23.620
I'm a sardine...

00:16:23.930 --> 00:16:25.400
This is why I said not to!

00:16:25.400 --> 00:16:27.260
But I wasn't drowning...

00:16:27.780 --> 00:16:29.290
I just swallowed a little water...

00:16:30.390 --> 00:16:33.090
How can you defend yourself
when you're in this state?

00:16:34.100 --> 00:16:35.640
I can't watch this.

00:16:37.360 --> 00:16:39.560
Nice kicking.

00:16:39.940 --> 00:16:42.170
A swimming race against the athletics class?

00:16:42.170 --> 00:16:44.060
It was Ms. Saginomiya's idea.

00:16:46.560 --> 00:16:49.480
Interesting. Do not fear, ladies.

00:16:49.870 --> 00:16:53.990
With Hibiki in your class, you don't need 
to worry about a humiliating defeat.

00:16:54.320 --> 00:16:56.110
Is she a good swimmer?

00:16:56.110 --> 00:16:57.820
No, not really.

00:16:57.820 --> 00:17:01.290
<b>Happiness Class vs. Athletics Class</b>

00:16:58.440 --> 00:17:00.680
Behold my hidden strength!

00:17:01.750 --> 00:17:03.250
Here we go.

00:17:05.020 --> 00:17:05.960
Okay...

00:17:05.960 --> 00:17:08.920
<b>Whap</b>

00:17:06.430 --> 00:17:07.530
My stomach!

00:17:07.530 --> 00:17:08.920
A perfect belly flop!

00:17:26.200 --> 00:17:28.150
They're too fast.

00:17:29.040 --> 00:17:30.950
<i>These results were inevitable.</i>

00:17:31.480 --> 00:17:36.600
<i>The athletics class practices
daily to meet lofty goals.</i>

00:17:37.080 --> 00:17:41.640
<i>The happiness class that 
spends every day goofing off</i>

00:17:41.640 --> 00:17:43.750
<i>doesn't belong here with them.</i>

00:17:45.220 --> 00:17:49.710
<i>A student's hard work must never go unrewarded.</i>

00:17:52.760 --> 00:17:53.670
What's that?

00:17:58.010 --> 00:18:00.600
Those clouds look ominous.

00:18:00.640 --> 00:18:05.480
<b>Excited
Excited</b>

00:18:02.360 --> 00:18:05.480
It's finally time for our ace, 
Hibiki, to make her appearance.

00:18:05.790 --> 00:18:07.840
You guys just watch!

00:18:07.840 --> 00:18:11.860
Everyone, we're going to cancel
today's swimming lesson.

00:18:12.240 --> 00:18:13.570
What did you sa—

00:18:16.320 --> 00:18:16.840
Hibiki!

00:18:16.840 --> 00:18:18.890
Hibiki-chan, I'm coming for you!

00:18:21.990 --> 00:18:25.200
It was so sunny until just a moment ago.

00:18:26.470 --> 00:18:28.670
We should head to the locker room, too.

00:18:28.990 --> 00:18:29.690
Okay.

00:18:29.690 --> 00:18:31.370
Hibari-chan...

00:18:32.370 --> 00:18:33.840
What's wrong?

00:18:35.590 --> 00:18:37.800
Well, the thing is, I can't get out.

00:18:37.800 --> 00:18:38.600
Huh?

00:18:38.600 --> 00:18:40.300
I'm caught on something.

00:18:40.300 --> 00:18:42.040
What's wrong? Hurry up.

00:18:44.360 --> 00:18:47.230
Those storm clouds are
approaching frighteningly fast.

00:18:47.600 --> 00:18:50.810
Is this because of the happiness class, too?

00:18:51.300 --> 00:18:54.000
On top of that, there's Hanakoizumi-san.

00:18:54.000 --> 00:18:54.880
Huh?

00:18:54.880 --> 00:18:57.690
I'll prepare countermeasures 
against the lightning.

00:18:57.690 --> 00:18:59.340
Please handle things here.

00:18:59.340 --> 00:19:00.820
Got it. You girls—

00:19:02.140 --> 00:19:02.910
Botan!

00:19:02.910 --> 00:19:04.090
What are you doing?

00:19:04.090 --> 00:19:06.020
You can't do it alone, Botan.

00:19:06.020 --> 00:19:07.000
Hibarigaoka!

00:19:07.000 --> 00:19:08.460
But it's dangerous.

00:19:08.460 --> 00:19:12.330
It was me yesterday, so today it's
your turn to cause trouble for us.

00:19:12.330 --> 00:19:13.050
That's right.

00:19:13.050 --> 00:19:15.480
Hibari-chan, Botan-chan...

00:19:16.710 --> 00:19:18.300
Stop this!

00:19:18.300 --> 00:19:20.760
Do you realize how dangerous 
it is to be in the water?

00:19:20.760 --> 00:19:22.400
We do.

00:19:22.400 --> 00:19:26.100
That's why we can't leave Hanako-san here.

00:19:27.850 --> 00:19:28.720
Let's hurry.

00:19:28.720 --> 00:19:29.640
Yes, ma'am.

00:19:35.040 --> 00:19:36.400
What was that?

00:19:36.770 --> 00:19:38.600
Lightning struck nearby.

00:19:40.020 --> 00:19:42.060
Where are the other three?

00:19:42.060 --> 00:19:43.110
Maybe still at the pool.

00:19:43.600 --> 00:19:44.570
What?!

00:19:45.050 --> 00:19:46.580
It struck the schoolyard.

00:19:47.010 --> 00:19:48.500
You girls really are...

00:19:50.620 --> 00:19:51.470
What are you...

00:19:52.090 --> 00:19:53.800
Let's go underwater, everyone.

00:19:53.800 --> 00:19:54.250
Huh?

00:19:54.710 --> 00:19:57.460
There's no time. Please trust me.

00:19:57.460 --> 00:19:58.460
Got it.

00:19:58.460 --> 00:19:59.180
What do you—

00:19:59.180 --> 00:20:00.510
Ms. Saginomiya, I'm sorry!

00:20:00.510 --> 00:20:01.230
Hey!

00:20:19.140 --> 00:20:21.740
Could it... Could it be...

00:20:21.740 --> 00:20:27.110
Hibarigaoka Ruri! I, Hibiki, 
shall deliver your requiem!

00:20:27.110 --> 00:20:28.450
Don't just assume I'm dead.

00:20:31.270 --> 00:20:32.680
Did the lightning strike the pool?

00:20:32.680 --> 00:20:35.400
Electric currents dissipate in water,

00:20:35.400 --> 00:20:38.660
so it's actually safer inside 
the pool than right next to it.

00:20:39.590 --> 00:20:41.590
I read about it online.

00:20:45.050 --> 00:20:46.760
<b>Nurse's Office</b>

00:20:47.160 --> 00:20:48.580
You have a low fever.

00:20:48.580 --> 00:20:52.140
Normally I wouldn't believe
it was possible for someone

00:20:52.140 --> 00:20:55.400
to get stuck on a lane line like that.
Only you, Hanako...

00:20:56.920 --> 00:20:59.770
Kumegawa, you have a terribly high fever.

00:21:01.090 --> 00:21:04.240
I'm sorry I'm such a weak 
and useless piece of trash.

00:21:04.960 --> 00:21:06.200
You're not trash at all.

00:21:07.520 --> 00:21:09.520
You were unable to dive underwater,

00:21:09.520 --> 00:21:12.440
but when it counted, you drew 
from the knowledge you had

00:21:12.440 --> 00:21:14.660
and showed willingness 
to take on challenges.

00:21:15.120 --> 00:21:16.550
You did well.

00:21:18.020 --> 00:21:19.340
Ms. Saginomiya...

00:21:19.780 --> 00:21:22.800
And you trusted your 
classmate and took action.

00:21:26.450 --> 00:21:30.390
I've decided to wait and see how the 
happiness class does for a while.

00:21:33.800 --> 00:21:35.610
What did she mean by that?

00:21:36.620 --> 00:21:38.480
She's just hiding her embarrassment.

00:21:38.730 --> 00:21:39.770
Oh...

00:21:39.770 --> 00:21:42.980
Hibari-chan, Botan-chan. Thanks—

00:21:45.070 --> 00:21:47.490
I knew she'd accumulated some charge.

00:21:48.700 --> 00:21:52.870
So it was actually Hanako-san that saved us?

00:21:49.240 --> 00:21:50.910
Thunder woman...

00:21:53.230 --> 00:21:54.890
Maybe.

00:21:55.720 --> 00:21:59.310
<i>But if they were struck while in the pool,</i>

00:21:59.310 --> 00:22:01.040
<i>they shouldn't have escaped unhurt...</i>

00:22:01.460 --> 00:22:03.180
You did well, too.

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:40.020
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:40.020
<b>July 20</b>

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:40.020
<b>Our Summer Vacation</b>

00:23:40.020 --> 00:23:43.020
Don't miss the next episode!
